tegory.{v₁, u₁} C] {D : Type u₂} [inst_1 : CategoryTheory.Category.{v₂, u₂} D]  
 (self : CategoryTh…
· 使用定理 `eq_self`：∀ {α : Sort u_1} (a : α), (a = a) = True
